# The edit-mode command menu offers Clear Due Date only on a block that has a due date, and it removes it.
file <<END
- Dated @due({today})
- Plain
END
keys j <Enter>
type /due
see Set Due Date
hide Clear Due Date
keys <BS> <BS> <BS> <BS> <Esc> k <Enter>
type /clear due
see Clear Due Date
keys <Enter> <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Dated
- Plain
END
